{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/Status"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:appearance:shape:size:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(label:status:appearance:shape:size:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(loadingKey:tableName:bundle:progress:shape:size:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(loadingLabel:progress:shape:size:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/Appearance","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/Shape","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/Size"],"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTag"}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSTag","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents7OUDSTagV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTag"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tag is a UI element that allows to display short info like a label, keyword, or category."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tag helps users quickly find, group, or understand content."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTag","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","text":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags have two appearances so as to highlight or not their content:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"emphasized"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with a solid, high-contrast background. Used to draw strong attention to important"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"labels or categories. Emphasized tags stand out prominently against the interface and are ideal for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"primary or high-priority information."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"muted"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with a subtle, light, or semi-transparent background. Used for secondary or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"less prominent information. Muted tags blend more with the background, providing a softer visual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emphasis compared to emphasized tags."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Status","type":"heading","text":"Status"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags have seven status depending on the context of the information they represent. Each state is designed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to convey a specific meaning and ensure clarity in communication."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Default or inactive state. Used for standard labels, categories, or when no specific"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status needs to be communicated."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Used to draw attention to new features, recommendations, or content suggestions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Invites users to explore and engage with new offerings, creating an exciting and engaging experience."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Indicates success, confirmation, or a positive status. Commonly used to highlight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completed actions or approved items."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Signals caution or a potentially risky situation. Used to draw attention to items"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requiring user awareness or intervention."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Represents errors, critical issues, or urgent attention needed. Used to highlight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"problems or failed actions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Conveys informational messages or supplementary details. Used for neutral, helpful,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or contextual information."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Disabled"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Shows that the tag is inactive and cannot be interacted with. Appears faded or greyed out. This is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"allowed when loader is activated."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Shape","type":"heading","text":"Shape"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags can have two shapes:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rounded"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with fully rounded corners, creating a pill-shaped appearance. Rounded"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tags offer a softer and more approachable look, suitable for most modern interfaces."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Square"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with sharp, square corners. Squared tags provide a more formal, structured, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"technical feel. They are often used in business contexts to label promotions, offers, or important notices."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Size","type":"heading","text":"Size"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags can have two sizes:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Default"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The standard tag size, suitable for most use cases and offering good readability."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Small"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A compact tag with reduced height and font size. Used when saving space is important or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when grouping elements visually."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","text":"Layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are four available layouts for tags:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"-"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text only"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A tag that displays only text. Used for simple labels, categories, or keywords without additional visual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"-"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text + Bullet"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with a small indicator (dot) alongside the text. Used to show status, presence, or activity"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next to the label."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"-"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text + Icon"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A tag that includes an icon before the text. Used to visually reinforce the meaning of the tag,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as status, type, or action."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text + Loader"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A tag that combines a loading spinner (or progress indicator) with text. Used to indicate that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a process or action related to the tag is in progress."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Text only with neutral status, for emphasized appearance with rounded shape in default size","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\",  status: .neutral(), appearance: .emphasized, shape: .rounded, size: .default)","    \/\/ Or also","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\")","    \/\/ Or from a localizale and a bundle","    OUDSTag(LocalizedStringKey(\"label_wording\"), bundle: Bundle.module)","","    \/\/ Tag with neutral status with bullet","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(leading: .bullet)","","    \/\/ Tag with neutral status with a custom decorative icon","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"))))","    \/\/ If your layout is in RTL mode but your tag has an icon with another meaning because of bad orientation,","    \/\/ you can flip the icon using OUDSImage.flipped","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), flipped: true)))","    \/\/ If you want to display a raw image (not tinted), use renderingMode: .original","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_brand\"), renderingMode: .original)))","","    \/\/ Text with neutral status with bullet","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(bullet: true))","","    \/\/ Tag with indeterminate circular progress indicator, with rounded shape in small size","    OUDSTag(loadingLabel: \"Processing...\", shape: .rounded, size: .small)","","    \/\/ Tag with determinate circular progress indicator, with rounded shape in default size","    OUDSTag(loadingLabel: \"Processing...\", progress: 0.75)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-tag"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Orange"}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_OrangeCompact"}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Sosh"}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","text":"Wireframe"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Wireframe"}]},{"name":"Version","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.5.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"name":"Since","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.18.0"}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstag"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/Indicators":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"topic","title":"Indicators","kin